<li>One-touch takeoff and landing plus 2.4GHz control that’s responsive enough to feel like you’re doing it on purpose</li>
<li>360° stunt flips because at some point you will absolutely wonder “what happens if I press this”</li>
<li>Dual batteries for a second run at being briefly, confidently in charge of something airborne</li>
